 to get your vacation scheduled! This beautiful site has a log shelter with electric and water hookups. Complete with picnic table and fire ring, this structure features a sloped roof and three log walls where you can put your tent or belongings to stay off the ground and dry. The shelter is 12ft wide x 10ft deep x 8ft tall, and is perfect for hardcore campers who love the outdoors and have plenty of","photo":"data:image/png;base64,","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":2}]},{"name":"Glamping Pod","desc":"Cabin camping at Mountain Vista Campground allows you to enjoy the beauty of the Poconos and escape into the forest setting with comfort and convenience. With six different cabin styles to choose from, there’s an accommodating option to suit the preferences of all our guests! Camping Cabins are 20 feet in length and 13 feet wide, including a 6-foot open porch. For sleeping, one room log cabins have a double bed across from a set of bunk beds. The cabins are located close to the facilities. Daily (Thurs-Sun): $117.00 Daily (Mon-Wed): $110.00 Holiday Daily: $137.00 Halloween Daily: $130.00 Weekly: $635.00 Camping Cabins are 26 feet in length and 13 feet wide, including a 6-foot open porch and","photo":"https://mountainvistacampground.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/xCabin-Camping-Mountain-Vista-Pocono-Camping.jpg.pagespeed.ic.TXUbUtj6Dm.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":3}],"explain":[{"term":"Glamping","meaning":"Camping in a furnished tent or cabin with a real bed."}]},{"name":"Two Pickleball Courts","desc":"Our two pickleball courts allow for both competitive and casual pickleball players alike to get their game on and spend an afternoon serving and","photo":"https://mountainvistacampground.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Mountain-Vista-Pocono-Camping-Activities-PickleBall.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":4}],"explain":[{"term":"Pickleball","meaning":"A paddle game like tennis on a small court, easy for beginners."}]},{"name":"Disc Golf","desc":"Mountain Vista’s 6-hole disc golf course combines friendly competition with the beauty of our campground in this game that’s fun for all ages! View our Disc Golf Course","photo":"https://mountainvistacampground.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/Mountain-Vista-Pocono-Camping-Activities-Disc-Golf.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":5}]},{"name":"Lehigh Valley Zoo","desc":null,"photo":"https://mountainvistacampground.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/PA-Camping-Pocono-Attractions-20.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":6}]},{"name":"Picnic Tables","desc":"For all our guests at Mountain Vista, there are picnic tables throughout the campground to give you countless options for enjoying a meal in the great","photo":"https://mountainvistacampground.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/Mountain-Vista-Pocono-Camping-Amenities-Picnic-Tables.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":7}]}],"includes":[],"addons":[],"gap":"Prices, hours and eligibility are not copied here yet. We will ask when you request.","cover":"https://mountainvistacampground.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/Mountain-Vista-Pocono-Family-Camping-18.jpg","photos":["https://mountainvistacampground.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/Mountain-Vista-Pocono-Family-Camping-18.jpg","https://mountainvistacampground.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/xMoutain-Vista-Poconos-RV-Camping.jpg.pagespeed.ic.A5xnxeoM7j.jpg","https://mountainvistacampground.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/xMoutain-Vista-Poconos-Cabin-Camping.jpg.pagespeed.ic.PNxJDOEH-G.jpg","https://mountainvistacampground.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/xMoutain-Vista-Poconos-Tent-Camping.jpg.pagespeed.ic.jy02oUkNeN.jpg","https://mountainvistacampground.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/xPhoto-Gallery-Mountain-Vista-Pocono-Camping-1.jpg.pagespeed.ic.1I4tLVod6v.jpg","https://mountainvistacampground.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/Poconos-Camping-Family-Activitie